`benchmark.meta description: Reads buffered character streams through EOF at exact and partial growth boundaries.
`benchmark.meta timing: recommended
`benchmark.meta profiles: allocator,compile-timing

/core/tokenstream

. source = "x" * 2097152
. checksum = 0 as Size
for size in [0, 1024, 1500, 1048576, 1500000, 2097152]
    . stream = ChunkedTokenStream'Char(source[0 .. < size].codepoints)
    . result = stream.read()
    if result.size != size || stream.has-more
        Panic("read-all length mismatch")
    checksum += result.size

-- "bench-result stream/read-all checksum=$checksum"
